    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Conerney Estate Agents are delighted to present to market No. 39 Beaufort Downs, an excellent three-bedroom semi-detached residence situated in this mature and highly sought-after residential development in Rathfarnham.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 86 sq.m, this attractive family home has been significantly upgraded by the current owners and is presented in excellent condition throughout, with a number of recent improvements making this a superb opportunity for buyers seeking a home that is ready to move into.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the property, you are greeted by a welcoming entrance hallway, complete with a brand-new triple-insulated front door. The spacious living room is positioned to the front of the property and benefits from a large window allowing an abundance of natural light, along with a brand-new fuel-burning stove creating an attractive focal point to the room.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the property has been opened up to create a bright and spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area, ideal for modern family living and entertaining. The brand-new kitchen is finished to a high standard with an extensive range of fitted wall and floor units, generous countertop space and a breakfast bar, complemented by new laminate flooring throughout the area.\r\n\r\nUpstairs there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, with new fitted wardrobes having been installed in two of the three bedrooms.\r\n\r\nA particular feature of the property is the brand-new bathroom, which has been completely refurbished to an excellent standard. Fully tiled throughout, the bathroom has been comprehensively waterproofed to both the floor and walls and incorporates a contemporary vanity unit, modern sanitary ware and a stylish walk-in shower.\r\n\r\nFurther improvements include newly upgraded attic insulation together with the addition of new attic flooring, providing additional insulation as well as useful storage space.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from generous off-street parking to the front, while both the front and rear gardens have been designed with low-maintenance living in mind.\r\n\r\nWith its brand-new kitchen and bathroom, open-plan living space, new fuel-burning stove, upgraded insulation, new front door and numerous other improvements, No. 39 represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-maintained and substantially upgraded family home in an established Rathfarnham location.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys convenient access to a wide range of local amenities including schools, shops, parks, sporting facilities and public transport links, with Rathfarnham Village and the wider South Dublin area within easy reach.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment with Conerney Estate Agents."
      },
